    <unit id="=&gt;q2" name="=&gt;q2">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">4</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Zone Rats yo.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Зонні щури, йо.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q3" name="=&gt;q3">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">6</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Damn it! Both Sneaky and Gorsky died. Now what?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чорт забирай! Снікі та Горський загинули. Що тепер?&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I feel bad about Gorsky, but at least we still have Sneaky, yo. Gorsky was hardcore!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Мені шкода Горського, але принаймні у нас ще є Снікі, йо. Горський був крутим!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q5" name="=&gt;q5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I heard Protectorate got their ass handed to them in Junkyard. Yea!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я чув, що Протекторат отримав по голові на Звалищі. Єєа!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Those Black Crawlers really gave us a fight. But we dominated!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Ці Чорні Повзуни дали нам бій. Але ми їх розбили!&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Damn it! Sneaky died. I hope Gorsky knows what he's doing.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Чорт забирай! Снікі помер. Сподіваюся, Горський знає, що робить.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>That Dan guy was hardcore, yo. Too bad about his death.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Той Дан був крутим, йо. Шкода про його смерть.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>It's a mess here now, but we'll take care of this place, yo.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Тут зараз безлад, але ми тут все приберемо, йо.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Dirty Tom's our new merchant. That guy's got some cool stuff.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Брудний Том – наш новий торговець. У цього хлопця є дещо класне.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q11" name="=&gt;q11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Let's see if this Dan man can take care of this place. ::Sighs.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Подивимося, чи зможе цей Дан навести тут лад. ::Зітхає.::&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm just thankful the Faceless haven't returned for their tunneler.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="needs-translation">Я просто радий, що Безликі не повернулися за своїм тунельщиком.&lt;end&gt;</target>
      </segment>
    </unit>
